.TH "legofy" "1" "03 Dec 2015" "1.0.0" "JuanPotato" ""
.SH "NAME"
lefofy \- Make images look as if they are made out of 1x1 LEGO blocks
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
legofy [OPTIONS] IMAGE [OUTPUT]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Legofy is a python program that takes a static image or gif and makes it so that it looks as if it was built out of LEGO
